<title>USA: Cascade Bancorp sets 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>Cascade Bancorp sets 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>BEND, Ore. 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cascade Bancorp said Tuesday it declared a two-for-one split of its common shares.</p>
<p>The company said it will distribute shares July 8, 1997 to shareholders of record on July 1.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
